      "status": "WORKS",
      "builtIn": true,
      "notes": "Uses a search token and a Firebase key that PlayTorrio found inside the Audionest app, not credentials issued to OwnTV. They worked on 2026-10-04 and may stop at any time. Put your own search token in API key to replace the built-in one."
